      },
      "text": "By the authority vested in me as President by the Constitution and laws of the \nUnited States of America, it is hereby ordered:\nSerfjon 1. All Executive departments and agencies of the Federal Government \nshall be closed and their employees excused from duty for the last half of the \nscheduled workday on Christmas Eve, December 24,1987, except as provided \nin Section 2 below."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 1492,
